  "assumptions": [
    "Only the OAuth 2.0 authorization-code flow is described in the source. Box also offers server-side options (JWT or client credentials) that survive a person leaving, but the source does not document them, so they are not listed.",
    "Box has no per-user last-login field in the user record, so usage comes from the enterprise event log. This needs an admin user and an app with the 'manage enterprise properties' scope.",
